SEPC Limited, formerly known as Shriram EPC Limited, is an engineering, procurement, and construction company incorporated in 2000 and headquartered in Chennai, Tamil Nadu. It provides integrated design, engineering, procurement, construction, and project management services across water, process and metallurgy, infrastructure, and industrial projects in India and international markets.
SEPC is listed on the National Stock Exchange under the ticker SEPC and on the Bombay Stock Exchange under the code 532945. The company is engaged in water and municipal services, roads, industrial infrastructure, and mining projects, which exposes it to domestic government-led and private sector capex cycles.
